@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom order-triage runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives an asynchronous canonical-instruction loader. The custom runtime must supply that loader, resolve `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`, and use the returned content as the agent instruction.
+
+The factory fixes the runtime-facing ID to `order-triage`, its action to `classify-for-human-review`, and `canApproveRefunds` to `false`. This repository does not establish an order schema, model-visible tools, provider capabilities, or a refund execution path.
